          </label>
<input class="field-control" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-telefon" name="formular-odoslat-formular[telefon]" type="tel" value=""/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="field field-form_textarea" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-wrapper-vasa-sprava">
<div class="field-wrapper">
<label for="formular-odoslat-formular-field-vasa-sprava" id="formular-odoslat-formular-label-vasa-sprava">
            Vaša správa
          </label>
<textarea class="field-control" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-vasa-sprava" name="formular-odoslat-formular[vasa-sprava]"></textarea>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="block block-inline"><p>Vaše osobné údaje budú spracované v súlade s <a href="/sk/podmienky-spracovania-osobnych-udajov-formular">Podmienkami spracovania osobných údajov</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12">
<div class="field field-form_button" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-wrapper-odoslat-formular">
<div class="field-wrapper">
<div class="center">
<button class="btn btn-s btn-default" id="formular-odoslat-formular-field-odoslat-formular" name="formular-odoslat-formular[odoslat-formular]" type="submit" value="submit"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">ODOSLAŤ FORMULÁR</span></button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<input name="form_variant" type="hidden" value="formular-odoslat-formular"/><input name="page" type="hidden" value=""/><div aria-hidden="true" class="visually-hidden"><label>Web <input autocomplete="off" name="website" tabindex="-1" type="text"/></label></div></form>
</div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(242, 242, 242)"></div></div>
